# @type Rover
# @class Rover
#
# @maintainer DYX
#
# DYX 3WD pre-line marking rover (Pixhawk 6X, RoboClaw on GPS2, UM982 on TELEM1, spray on AUX1). Vehicle-type defaults
# carried from the field-validated rover 01 configuration (2026-10-13..16, firmware 08450195f2): the stock differential
# rover defaults first, then these, so these win. Per-rover calibration is NOT here and stays per rover
# (DYX_3WD dyx3-fmu param apply): RBCLW_COUNTS_REV, RBCLW_QPPS_MAX, RO_MAX_THR_SPEED (RoboClaw autotune / encoder),
# EKF2_WENC_RAD (rolling radius), BAT*_V_DIV (power module), RC*_REV / RC_CHAN_CNT (transmitter), CAL_* (sensors).
# MAV_2_CONFIG stays at the board default 0 (no MAVLink on Ethernet; QGC on Ethernet is a live setting only).
#

